<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-009" chapter-id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xichao" source-id="s-jinshu-009-jin067-xichao">
  <p id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xichao:deposition" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">時中書郎<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xichao:deposition:m0004" ref="57b_1cb_a1b">郗超</persName>在直，帝乃引入，謂曰：「命之修短，本所不計，故當無復近日事邪！」<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xichao:deposition:m0038" ref="57b_1cb_a1b">超</persName>曰：「大司馬臣<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xichao:deposition:m0046" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>方內固社稷，外恢經略，非常之事，臣以百口保之。」</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xichao:greeting" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">及<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xichao:greeting:m0001" ref="57b_1cb_a1b">超</persName>請急省其父，帝謂之曰：「致意尊公，家國之事，遂至於此！</p>
</text>
